  "description": "Minimum Size Subarray Sum (LeetCode 209) explained: the shortest window with sum at least target, grown on the right and squeezed on the left, O(n) time, plus the O(n log n) prefix-sum binary search, in Go, C++, Java, Python.",
  "hero": {
