      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window (shortest covering)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/minimum-size-subarray-sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 209</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Minimum Size Subarray Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">All values are positive, so a window's sum grows when it grows and drops when it shrinks. Grow the right edge until the sum reaches the target, then squeeze the left edge while it still does, recording each length. O(n) time, O(1) space; the O(n log n) follow-up is binary search on prefix sums.</p>\n"
  },
